From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] shell: focus overlay after controller attachment

After correcting the drifted 0051 placement, ensure the focus call is present
at the stable end of `_setup_main_window` rather than inside the key callback.

---
 src/jarabe/main.py | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/jarabe/main.py b/src/jarabe/main.py
--- a/src/jarabe/main.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/main.py
@@ -308,3 +308,4 @@ def _setup_main_window(shell_instance):
         zoom_controller.connect("key-pressed", _capture_zoom_key)
         shell_instance._main_window.add_controller(zoom_controller)
         shell_instance._sugar_zoom_controller = zoom_controller
+        shell_instance._main_window.set_focus(shell_instance._overlay)
